{"id":"e2431dc0f64e0f95","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-boolean-2.md","title":"Boolean Algebra 2","display":"Boolean Algebra 2","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-boolean-2","aliases":["93-fact-boolean-2"],"display":"Boolean Algebra 2","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-boolean-2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-boolean-2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Boolean Algebra 2"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" href=\"?note=32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" title=\"93-df-finite-algebra\">93-df-finite-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-boolean-2-—-Boolean-Algebra-2\">fact-boolean-2 — Boolean Algebra 2</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2_{93}\">\\(2_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Meet2}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Meet2}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Join2}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Join2}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neg2}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Neg2}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Zero2}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Zero2}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{One2}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{One2}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BA2OpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BA2OpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and the algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span> are defined below using the Boolean type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span> of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" href=\"?note=32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" title=\"93-df-finite-algebra\">93-df-finite-algebra</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n2_{93}\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n2_{93}\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Meet2}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\min\\{a,b\\}\\rangle:a,b\\in2_{93}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Meet2}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\min\\{a,b\\}\\rangle:a,b\\in2_{93}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Join2}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\max\\{a,b\\}\\rangle:a,b\\in2_{93}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Join2}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\max\\{a,b\\}\\rangle:a,b\\in2_{93}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Neg2}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\langle1,0\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Zero2}_{93}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{One2}_{93}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,1\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Neg2}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\langle1,0\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Zero2}_{93}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{One2}_{93}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,1\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BA2OpFam}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{Meet2}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{Join2}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{Neg2}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{Zero2}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{One2}_{93}\\rangle\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BA2OpFam}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{Meet2}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{Join2}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{Neg2}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{Zero2}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{One2}_{93}\\rangle\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\mathbf2\\coloneqq\\langle2_{93},\\operatorname{BA2OpFam}_{93}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\mathbf2\\coloneqq\\langle2_{93},\\operatorname{BA2OpFam}_{93}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf2)\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf2)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf2)=\\{\\Delta_{\\mathbf2},\\nabla_{\\mathbf2}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf2)\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf2)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf2)=\\{\\Delta_{\\mathbf2},\\nabla_{\\mathbf2}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equati